      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "These \"hacked version\" clients, aka modded clients, just use the notification API with message type invite and the content of the message set to something else than the world name and exclude the world ID from the message, so technically not even a \"hack\", just using the API in a non-standard way. There used to be a special message endpoint that VRChat removed again by now and I don't think they will bring it back any time soon which is very unfortunate as it would make communication with mute people (and yes, there's a lot of them) a lot easier and more relaxing.",
